    <Description>Lars Alexandersson is a character in the Tekken franchise who is the leader of the rebel army Yggdrasil and a major protagonist in the series. He is the illegitimate son of Heihachi Mishima and a former officer in the Tekken Force, a special military unit of the Mishima Zaibatsu.After leading a coup against the Zaibatsu, Lars formed Yggdrasil to fight against G Corp, which is led by Kazuya Mishima, Heihachi's other son. Lars' fighting style is Tekken Force Martial Arts, and his moveset is described as swift and flashy, different from the heavy tactics of Mishima karate.

Set your keys to this
1=J
2=I
3=K
4=L

set to input while holding key.

This combo will allow you to mixup heavy to make up for lars fake pressure</Description>
